  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover comfort and style with Our Womens Camo Performance Workout Leggings. Whether you're hitting the gym or relaxing at home, these leggings are perfect for any activity. Crafted from performance fabric, the camo leggings wick away moisture to keep you cool and dry. The workout pants feature an ankle zipper and hidden waistband pocket for added convenience. Made from a durable 90% polyester / 10% spandex fabric blend, the workout leggings offer a full range of motion. Complete your look with our matching Performance Tank Top.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "1806",
